WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:11.100
Workers guide a precast concrete footing suspended from crane slings across a prepared concrete slab, walking beside it with their hands on it.

00:11.100 --> 00:13.900
A close view: two workers lean into the footing with gloved hands as it is lowered.

00:13.900 --> 00:16.900
A worker crouched beside the footing presses a gloved hand against its side.

00:16.900 --> 00:21.800
Two workers crouch against the footing, pressing it with their hands to seat it on its guide hardware.
